OL,4,BFrustration reigns for Pochettino in   
OL,5,Bchaotic start to Man Utd job           
OL,6,GTwo games, no wins. Two red cards, two 
OL,7,Ggoals scored. One goal disallowed, six 
OL,8,Gconceded. Is it possible for Mauricio  
OL,9,GPochettino to have learned anything    
OL,10,Gfrom a crazy first week as Manchester  
OL,11,GUnited boss?                           
OL,13,FUnited and Pochettino went on the      
OL,14,Fwarpath before the Champions League    
OL,15,Fencounter with Sporting, furious at    
OL,16,FLeny Yoro's dismissal at Liverpool     
OL,17,Fwhich they believe was unjust and      
OL,18,Fshaped the eventual 4-0 defeat.        
OL,20,FClub officials were seething after the 
OL,21,F2-2 draw in Lisbon as well.            
